  _cardName: "Manuten\xE7\xE3o Preditiva com IA"
  _description: "Sensores e algoritmos preveem falha em tubula\xE7\xE3o, rede el\xE9trica
    ou pavimento antes que ela aconte\xE7a. Pr\xE1tica real de manuten\xE7\xE3o preditiva
    com IA, cada vez mais usada por concession\xE1rias de \xE1gua e energia \u2014
    economiza reparo emergencial, mas reduz postos de manuten\xE7\xE3o manual."
  _cardNameEn: AI Predictive Maintenance
  _descriptionEn: "Sensors and algorithms predict a failure in piping, the power
    grid or pavement before it happens. Real predictive-maintenance-with-AI practice,
    increasingly used by water and power utilities \u2014 saves on emergency repairs,
    but cuts manual maintenance jobs."
